2026-06-05 16:44:15.986 | DEBUG  | logging:callHandlers:1737 | Submitting callback functools.partial(<built-in method run of _contextvars.Context object at 0x1697acc00>, <bound method Embedder._embed_sync of <src.embedder.Embedder object at 0x136693620>>, '[BASELINE SURVEY REPORT ON AGRICULTURAL NEEDS AND PRACTICES OF BENEFICIARIES.pdf - PRACTICES OF BENEFICIARIES IN PALABEK]\nPART 5: Markets and Digital Tools \nMarketing \n34. Where and to whom do you sell your products? \n35. Which products sell best and at what times of the year? \n36. Do you sell individually or in groups? \n37. Is there local demand for improved legumes or processed products? \nProcessing and value addition \n38. Do you process any products before selling? \n39. Would you be interested in conservation/processing techniques? \nAccess to inputs \n40. Where do you get seeds and tools? Are they for good quality and affordable? \nDigital technologies \n41. Do you own a phone?  \n42. Do you use it for agricultural information (weather, prices)? \n43. Would you be interested in agricultural services via mobile?', False) with args () and kwargs {} to thread worker queue
