2026-06-05 16:52:51.616 | DEBUG  | logging:callHandlers:1737 | Submitting callback functools.partial(<built-in method run of _contextvars.Context object at 0x31f9a02c0>, <bound method Embedder._embed_sync of <src.embedder.Embedder object at 0x136693620>>, '[REVISED SUSTAINABLE AGRICULTURE TRAINING GUIDE.pdf - TABLE OF CONTENTS]\n• \nWatering: Water the seedlings morning and evening, using a fine watering can to avoid \ndamaging them. The soil should remain moist but not waterlogged. ..................................... 58 \n• \nThinning: When the seedlings have developed 2 to 3 true leaves, pull out the weaker \nones to give more space to the more vigorous ones. ................................................................ 58 \n• \nWeeding: Gently remove weeds by hand as soon as they appear. .................................. 58 \n• \nHardening off: This is a crucial step to prepare the seedlings for the shock of \ntransplanting. About one to two weeks before the planned transplanting date: ................... 58 \n1. \nGradually reduce the shade by removing part of the cover each day. ............................. 58 \n2. \nGradually reduce the frequency of watering, without letting the plants wilt completely.', False) with args () and kwargs {} to thread worker queue
